sequenceDiagram
    actor User as User (Web / Slack)
    participant Bot as Bot Core
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Daytona as Daytona Sandbox
    participant Claude as Claude Code (in sandbox)
    participant GH as GitHub

    User->>Bot: "Add a health check endpoint"
    Bot->>DB: Look up conversation (org, thread_id)
    DB-->>Bot: ErrNotFound → new conversation

    Bot->>DB: Look up org config (default repo, Anthropic key)
    DB-->>Bot: org config

    alt No default repo set
        Bot-->>User: "Which repo? Reply with owner/name"
        Bot->>DB: Save partial conversation (awaiting repo)
        User->>Bot: "acme/website"
    end

    Bot->>GH: Get installation token (scoped to repo)
    GH-->>Bot: Short-lived installation token

    Bot->>DB: Upsert conversation row (repo set, no sandbox yet)
    Bot-->>User: "Spinning up sandbox for acme/website…"

    Bot->>Daytona: Create sandbox (from snapshot)
    Daytona-->>Bot: Sandbox ID

    Bot-->>User: "Sandbox ready — cloning repo"

    Bot->>Daytona: Write agent.sh to sandbox
    Bot->>Daytona: Run agent.sh (with ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, GITHUB_TOKEN, prompt)

    loop Claude Code stream (NDJSON)
        Daytona-->>Bot: stdout line (setup echo / Claude JSON event)
        Bot-->>User: SSE block update (setup / tool_use / claude_text)
    end

    Claude->>GH: git push + gh pr create
    GH-->>Claude: PR URL

    Claude-->>Daytona: Last line = PR URL
    Daytona-->>Bot: PR URL extracted

    Bot->>Daytona: Stop + archive sandbox

    Bot-->>User: "Done! https://github.com/acme/website/pull/42"
    Bot->>DB: Upsert conversation (sandbox_id, branch, pr_url, blocks)
